# Unquoted twin of exclude_wildcard_routine_f90.tau (issue #64): a leading
# '#' starts a comment even inside a list block, so "#routine" is ignored,
# nothing is excluded and both subprograms keep their timers. The
# instrumentor warns and suggests quoting the line to use it as a wildcard.
BEGIN_EXCLUDE_LIST
#routine
END_EXCLUDE_LIST
